    "Reason : 1 - The proposal due to its size, scale and design, would result in a physically dominant, jarring and unsympathetic addition to the host property, which would unbalance the pair of houses and appear out of character with the street scene and surrounding area. This would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
